# ============================================================
# Fastly CDN / Edge Cloud
#
# Updated: 2026-09-30
#
# Sources:
#   https://api.fastly.com/public-ip-list
#   https://www.fastly.com/documentation/guides/concepts/routing-traffic-to-fastly/
#
# IMPORTANT:
#   Do NOT add no-resolve to IP-CIDR rules.
#
# Purpose:
#   - explicit Fastly hostnames -> PROXY immediately
#   - custom customer domains hosted on Fastly
#     -> DNS lookup -> Fastly IP match -> PROXY
#
# IPv6 intentionally omitted because Shadowrocket has ipv6=false.
# ============================================================


# ============================================================
# FASTLY ASSIGNED / SERVICE DOMAINS
# ============================================================

# Covers:
#   *.customer.fastly.net
#   *.map.fastly.net
#   *.sni.global.fastly.net
#   *.shared.global.fastly.net
#   *.global.ssl.fastly.net
#   *.global.prod.fastly.net
#   *.freetls.fastly.net
#   nonssl.global.fastly.net
#   nonssl.us-eu.fastly.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fastly.net

# Fastly Compute assigned domains
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,edgecompute.app


# ============================================================
# FASTLY OFFICIAL IPV4 RANGES
#
# NO no-resolve:
# unknown customer hostname must be resolvable so Shadowrocket
# can determine that the resulting IP belongs to Fastly.
# ============================================================

